.TH PGX-CLI 1 "June 2026" "pgx-cli" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pgx-cli \- command line wrapper for CLion MCP tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pgx-cli
[\fB--url\fR \fIMCP_URL\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pgx-cli
connects to a CLion MCP streamable HTTP endpoint and exposes stable commands for agents.
The default setup assumes CLion runs through JetBrains Gateway on thor:
.IP
Mac local tunnel URL: http://127.0.0.1:64343/stream
.IP
Thor remote MCP URL: http://127.0.0.1:64342/stream
.IP
Thor SSH host: comfy
.IP
Project path: /home/zel/repos/pgx-lower
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B tools [--json]
List MCP tools exposed by CLion.
.TP
.B schema \fITOOL\fR
Print the input schema for an MCP tool.
.TP
.B call \fITOOL\fR [\fIJSON_ARGS\fR]
Call any MCP tool by exact name. If configured, projectPath is added automatically unless JSON_ARGS already provides it.
.TP
.B tunnel
Start the SSH tunnel configured in the config file.
.TP
.B sync status
Show the configured Mutagen session status.
.TP
.B sync flush
Flush the configured Mutagen session.
.TP
.B dev status
Show Mutagen, remote branch, and task-spooler queue status for pgx-lower.
.TP
.B dev lint diff
Flush Mutagen, then run diff-scoped clang-tidy feedback for pgx-lower.
.TP
.B dev test focused
Flush Mutagen, then run the PostgreSQL unit-test gate on thor.
.TP
.B dev test tpch
Flush Mutagen, then run the TPC-H pg_regress correctness subset on thor.
.TP
.B dev gate batch
Run the fast batch-boundary workflow gate used by normal pre-push checks.
.TP
.B dev gate review
Run the full review-boundary workflow gate explicitly before PR review.
.TP
.B dev build explain --profile \fINAME\fR
Print resolved CMake/runtime profile settings without running CMake.
.TP
.B dev build compile --profile \fINAME\fR
Run a profile-selected CMake build command on thor.
.TP
.B docker status
Check whether the configured pgx-lower dev container is running on thor.
.TP
.B docker build ptest
Run the ptest CMake build and ctest flow inside the configured dev container on thor.
.TP
.B docker build release
Run the RelWithDebInfo extension build inside the configured dev container on thor.
.TP
.B queue status
Show pgx-lower build/check queue status.
.TP
.B queue flush
Clear completed pgx-lower build/check queue entries.
.TP
.B queue tail \fIID\fR
Tail a queued build job log by id.
.TP
.B queue cancel \fIID\fR
Cancel and remove a queued build job by id.
.TP
.B thor shell --dangerous -- \fICMD\fR [\fIARGS\fR...]
Flush Mutagen, then run an explicit shell command on thor in the configured pgx-lower checkout.
.TP
.B repo audit-tools
Fail if loose workflow helper scripts appear outside the approved pgx-cli-centered tool surface.
.TP
.B request feature \fIMESSAGE\fR...
Write a timestamped feature request Markdown file under ~/.config/pgx-cli/requests.
.TP
.B request complaint \fIMESSAGE\fR...
Write a timestamped complaint Markdown file under ~/.config/pgx-cli/requests.
.TP
.B doctor
Check the configured CLion MCP URL, thor MCP endpoint, project path, advertised tool count, and repository status.
.TP
.B clion doctor
Alias for the CLion MCP portion of doctor.
.TP
.B clion tools [--json]
List MCP tools exposed by CLion.
.TP
.B clion schema \fITOOL\fR
Print the input schema for an MCP tool.
.TP
.B clion call \fITOOL\fR [\fIJSON_ARGS\fR]
Call any MCP tool by exact name under the clion namespace.
.TP
.B config path
Print the config file path.
.TP
.B config show
Print the effective config.
.TP
.B config set-url \fIMCP_URL\fR
Set the local MCP URL.
.TP
.B config set-project \fIPROJECT_PATH\fR
Set the default project path passed to MCP tool calls.
.TP
.B config set-ssh-host \fISSH_HOST\fR
Set the SSH host used by the tunnel command.
.TP
.B problems
Run the diagnostics convenience command if the CLion MCP tool surface supports it.
.TP
.B file \fIPATH\fR
Read a project file through MCP.
.TP
.B open \fIPATH\fR
Open a project file in CLion through MCP.
.TP
.B search \fIQUERY\fR
Search files by name through MCP.
.TP
.B run \fICONFIGURATION_NAME\fR
Run a CLion run configuration through MCP.
.SH CONFIGURATION
The config file is:
.IP
~/.config/pgx-cli/config.json
.PP
Precedence for the MCP URL is:
.IP
--url, config file, CLION_MCP_URL, default thor tunnel URL
.PP
Other environment variables:
.IP
CLION_PROJECT_PATH
.IP
CLION_MCP_SSH_HOST
.IP
CLION_MCP_REMOTE_URL
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
pgx-cli tunnel
pgx-cli sync status
pgx-cli sync flush
pgx-cli dev status
pgx-cli dev lint diff
pgx-cli dev gate batch
pgx-cli dev build explain --profile debug
pgx-cli docker status
pgx-cli docker build ptest
pgx-cli docker build release
pgx-cli repo audit-tools
pgx-cli queue status
pgx-cli thor shell --dangerous -- git status --short
pgx-cli request feature make compile output easier to inspect
pgx-cli request complaint thor command output is too noisy
pgx-cli doctor
pgx-cli clion doctor
pgx-cli config show
pgx-cli tools
pgx-cli call get_repositories '{}'
pgx-cli call find_files_by_name_keyword '{"nameKeyword":"CMakeLists","fileCountLimit":5}'
.fi
